{"id":"input-245605f964ec","steamAppId":"2247790","name":"Snake Robot","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2247790/","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Sports"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"partial","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":0.17,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"170 MB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"Times are changing.","developers":["Gamesforgames"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:31:26.905971+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"Times are changing.","detailedDescription":"Times are changing. \n\r\n\n\r\nMeet the new hungry Snake Robot that destroys everything in its path. In this casual game, your main mission is to survive as long as possible by killing the enemies that want to stop you from growing. \n\r\n\n\r\nThe idea is that you will become bigger and bigger, becoming an obstacle even for yourself. Do you think you really know your own powers? Wait and see what will happen when you grow up.\n\r\n\n\r\nGame Features :\n\r\n- Permanent growth\n\r\n- Enemy robots\n\r\n- Fearless snake\n\r\n- Score/length"},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Thời thế đang thay đổi.","detailedDescription":"Thời thế đang thay đổi.\n\n\nHãy gặp robot Rắn đói mới phá hủy mọi thứ trên đường đi của nó. Trong trò chơi thông thường này, nhiệm vụ chính của anh là sống sót càng lâu càng tốt bằng cách giết những kẻ thù muốn ngăn cản anh phát triển.\n\n\nÝ tưởng là bạn sẽ trở nên ngày càng lớn hơn, trở thành một trở ngại ngay cả cho chính bạn. Ngươi nghĩ ngươi thực sự biết sức mạnh của chính mình sao? Hãy chờ xem chuyện gì sẽ xảy ra khi con lớn lên.\n\n\nTính năng trò chơi:\n- Phát triển không ngừng.\n- Robot địch.\n- Rắn không sợ\n- Điểm số/ độ dài"}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/header.jpg?t=1741196852"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741196852"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_aa77090ec74c963ff94615172c940a1cb54871ef.600x338.jpg?t=1741196852","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_aa77090ec74c963ff94615172c940a1cb54871ef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741196852"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_6ef3b477c8794026403631ced8f63aed8fc3f286.600x338.jpg?t=1741196852","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_6ef3b477c8794026403631ced8f63aed8fc3f286.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741196852"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_0f8845ea689ba5b5e54b02ac1ac9dded9f78c72a.600x338.jpg?t=1741196852","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_0f8845ea689ba5b5e54b02ac1ac9dded9f78c72a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741196852"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_f72bb7e921acb398f74e64d12915af79a2b7ef3d.600x338.jpg?t=1741196852","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_f72bb7e921acb398f74e64d12915af79a2b7ef3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741196852"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_625460209972e10e77e234af5ef3ca2b7f566cc7.600x338.jpg?t=1741196852","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247790/ss_625460209972e10e77e234af5ef3ca2b7f566cc7.1920x1080.jpg?t=17411